 "words_heard": 198,
 "words": 200,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Nobody has seen the Father, nobody has seen his face",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But love has come among us and it's living in this place",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sent his only Son to us so we might live through him",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That's how his love was shown to us, his love was shown in him",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dear friends, let us love one another",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For love is from God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever does not love does not know God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because God is love",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It was not that we loved him first, we never reached that high",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he loved us and sent his Son for our sins to die",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So if God loved us like this, then we know what to do",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We ought to love each other like he loved me and you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dear friends, let us love one another",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For love is from God",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whoever does not love does not know God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because God is love",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This is love: not that we have loved God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But that he loved us and sent his Son",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the atoning sacrifice for our sins",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one has ever seen God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But if we love one another, God remains in us",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because God is love",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.27,
